Akbar Ali Akbar (as)<br>
<br>
Shiddat e Sabr Se Mar Jaye Na Maa Akbar (as) Ki<br>
Din Madinay Main Woh Taqdeer Ne Dikhlaya Hai<br>
Jisne Mari Thi Kalajay Main Sinah Akbar (as) Ke<br>
Ban Ke Mehmaan Woh Sajjad (as) Ke Ghar Aya Hai<br>
Ghar Main Aya Hai Qatil e Akbar (as) Umme Laila Ko Hogaye Hai Khabar<br>
<br>
Sheh Taraptay Hain Qabr Ke Andar<br>
Maa Tarapti Hai Qabr Se Bahar<br>
Ghar Main Aya Hai Qatil e Akbar (as) Umme Laila Ko Hogaye Hai Khabar<br>
<br>
1. Phir Wohi Kaifiyat Hai Laila Ki Haal Tha Jo Jawan Ke Lashay Per<br>
Uske Qadmon Ki Ahatain Sun Kar Maa Ne Thama Hua Hai Apna Jigar<br>
Ghar Main Aya Hai Qatil e Akbar (as) Umme Laila Ko Hogaye Hai Khabar<br>
<br>
2. Chehra Karbobala Ki Janib Hai Pani Hathon Main Ly Ke Roti Hai <br>
Gir Raha Hai Nigaha Main Maa Ki Ali Akbar Ki Maut Ka Manzar<br>
Ghar Main Aya Hai Qatil e Akbar (as) Umme Laila Ko Hogaye Hai Khabar<br>
<br>
3. Umme Laila Sambhal Zainab Ko Kal Yea Shabbir Dy Rahe Thy Sada<br>
Ajj Abid Phuppi Se Kehte Hain Maa Ko Meri Sambhaliye Ja Kar <br>
Ghar Main Aya Hai Qatil e Akbar (as) Umme Laila Ko Hogaye Hai Khabar<br>
<br>
4. Qabr e Zahra Se Arhi Hai Sada Isne Mara Hai Mere Baba Ko <br>
Phir Madinay Main Ekk Qayamat Hai Phir Raha Hai Mazar e Paighambar<br>
Ghar Main Aya Hai Qatil e Akbar (as) Umme Laila Ko Hogaye Hai Khabar<br>
<br>
5. Ali Akbar Lipat Ke Qadmon Se Keh Rahe Honge Apne Baba Se <br>
Toot Jaye Na Zabt Ka Bandhan Hosla Maa Ko Dijiye Ja Kar <br>
Ghar Main Aya Hai Qatil e Akbar (as) Umme Laila Ko Hogaye Hai Khabar<br>
<br>
6. Sar e Akbar Utha Ke Nezay Per Umme Laila Ko Yea Dikhata Tha <br>
Usko Kaise Woh Bhool Sakti Hai Jis Se Khaye Thy Sham Main Pathar <br>
Ghar Main Aya Hai Qatil e Akbar (as) Umme Laila Ko Hogaye Hai Khabar<br>
<br>
7. Yea Kareemi Se Ruk Nahi Saktay Qatilon Ko Duain Detay Hain <br>
Is Se Pehle Ke Baksh Dain Abid Koi Mukhtar Se Kahay Ja Kar<br>
Ghar Main Aya Hai Qatil e Akbar (as) Umme Laila Ko Hogaye Hai Khabar<br>
<br>
Tumne Ne Sajjad Mujh Ko Pechana Sun Ke Qatil Se Bolay Yea Maula <br>
Tou Woh Ibne e Numair Hi Hai Na Jisne Tukray Kiya Humara Jigar <br>
Kal Thy Mehmaan Hum Teray Zalim Ajj Mehmaan Tou Humara Hai <br>
Aur Kuch Chahiya Bata Tujh Ko Abhi Kehdon Phuppi Se Main Jakar<br>
Ghar Main Aya Hai Qatil e Akbar (as) Umme Laila Ko Hogaye Hai Khabar<br>
<br>
8. Dil Nahi Lagta Ajj Ghar Main Mera Aye Takallum Yea Maa Ka Noha Tha<br>
Tham Kar Boli Mere Bazu Ko Le Chalay Fatima Ki Turbat Per <br>
Ghar Main Aya Hai Qatil e Akbar (as) Umme Laila Ko Hogaye Hai Khabar
